OL,3,GNEWSAInquests open after crash
OL,4,Afollowing police pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 62-year-old woman critically injured
OL,7,Fin a crash during a police pursuit died
OL,8,Fof multiple traumatic injuries, an
OL,9,Finquest has heard.
OL,11,FKaren Joseph, from Stratford-upon-Avon,
OL,12,Fdied in hospital on Friday 28 August,
OL,13,Ffour days after the collision involving
OL,14,Fher Ford Puma and a black Audi A3 on
OL,15,FWarwick Road, Coventry Coroner's Court
OL,16,Fheard.
OL,18,FThe driver of the Audi, who was being
OL,19,Fpursued by police, died at the scene
OL,20,Fand was named on Thursday as
OL,21,F19-year-old Roman Kalas.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
